sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 用户
    participant Host as 对话会话
    participant Speech as 语音提供方
    participant Director as 角色调度器
    participant Model as 模型表现通道
    User->>Host: 发送消息
    Host->>Director: turn.begin / turnId=A
    Host->>Director: state.thinking
    Host->>Host: 本地规则生成文本与语义
    Host->>Director: dialogue.reply / emotion=care
    Director->>Model: 按角色声明选择表情、动作、特效
    Host->>Speech: TTS 合成与播放
    Speech->>Director: state.speaking + speech.frame
    Director->>Model: 按音频时钟驱动口型
    User->>Host: 打断 / 新消息
    Host->>Speech: 取消合成与播放
    Host->>Director: turn.cancel / turnId=A
    Director->>Model: 淡回待机、释放表情、清除待执行项
    Speech-->>Director: 迟到的 A 轮事件
    Director-->>Host: 拒绝 STALE_TURN
